        "id": "enable_counter",
        "spec": "A 4-bit counter: reset q to zero; otherwise increment modulo 16 when en=1 and hold when en=0.\nUse one SystemVerilog module with the exact interface. All state updates on rising clk. rst is synchronous, active high, and has priority. No other modules, file I/O, delays, or simulation-only behavior in the DUT.",
